ement:\n- No `useState` for audio settings in components\n- No audio context lifecycle management\n- No audio parameter state tracking (volume, waveform, enabled)\n\n---\n\n### 3. Audio Types/Interfaces Defined\n\n**Location**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/types/index.ts` (lines 97-101)\n\n```typescript\nexport interface AudioParams {\n  enabled: boolean\n  volume: number\n  waveform: 'sine' | 'triangle' | 'square' | 'sawtooth'\n}\n```\n\nThis interface is included in the `ExpertSettings` interface (line 108), but:\n- There is no `SoundEngine` interface defined in `src/types/index.ts`\n- The `SoundEngine` interface exists only in the spec document (`specs/audio-sonification.md`)\n\n---\n\n### 4. What's Missing for Full Audio Sonification Implementation\n\n**Complete SoundEngine Class**:\n- `SoundEngine` class with AudioContext management\n- `setEnabled()` method\n- `setVolume()` method  \n- `setWaveform()` method\n- `playGenerationSound()` method (for birth events)\n- `playInteractionSound()` method (for draw/erase)\n- Lazy initialization pattern for AudioContext (browser autoplay policy)\n- Context resume logic for suspended states\n\n**Web Audio API Implementation**:\n- Oscillator creation with configurable waveforms\n- Gain node creation for volume and envelope control\n- Node graph: Oscillator → Gain → Destination\n- Quick attack and exponential decay envelopes\n- Cleanup/disconnect after sound completes\n- Polyphonic support (concurrent sounds)\n\n**React Integration**:\n- Audio state in `Game.tsx` component\n- Pass audio settings to child components\n- Audio callback functions for simulation steps and user interactions\n- Settings UI component for audio controls (checkbox, slider, dropdown)\n\n**UI Components**:\n- Volume slider (0.0-0.5, default 0.1)\n- Waveform selector (sine, triangle, square, sawtooth)\n- Enable/disable checkbox\n- Audio settings in `GlassHUD` or separate settings panel\n\n**Event Integration**:\n- Hook into `handleSimulationStep()` in `Game.tsx` for birth sounds (bornCount, averageRow available)\n- Hook into `handleCellClick()` in `GridInteraction.tsx` for draw/erase sounds\n- Trigger sounds during phase transitions\n\n**Testing**:\n- Unit tests for `SoundEngine` class\n- Integration tests for audio event triggers\n- Mock Web Audio API for test environment\n\n**Error Handling**:\n- Browser compatibility checks\n- Fallback for unsupported Web Audio API\n- Graceful handling of context suspension\n\n---\n\n## Additional Notes\n\n**Available Data for Audio**:\nThe simulation already tracks birth statistics that the spec requires:\n- `bornCount` (number of new cells born this generation)\n- `averageRow` (average row position of new births, for pitch mapping)\n- These are returned by `stepSimulation()` in `src/lib/simulation.ts` and available in `Game.tsx`\n\n**No TODO Comments**:\n- No TODO/FIXME comments found related to audio implementation\n- The implementation is completely missing, not just partially done\n\n**Spec Complete, Implementation Absent**:\n- The specification (`specs/audio-sonification.md`) is detailed and complete\n- The implementation plan (`IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`) has a checklist for audio features (lines 638-660, 738-741)\n- **None of these items have been implemented**\n</task_result>","title":"Search for audio implementation","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39d5e8656ffeVlMZZNbMP5dU40","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771181275559,"end":1771181345780}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771181369068,"sessionID":"ses_39d61732dffeDSmzfjmxT906s1","part":{"id":"prt_c62a17999001ZGEgizl5fgFUhU","sessionID":"ses_39d61732dffeDSmzfjmxT906s1","messageID":"msg_c62a11e14001bkXYFfswdAg3c7","type":"tool","callID":"call_1e9ba99f6e3d467fb287a70c","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Search for settings-related code","prompt":"Search the codebase comprehensively for any existing settings-related code:\n- Look for any SettingsPanel component or partial implementation\n- Search for audioParams, waveform, volume state in components\n- Find where audio parameters are currently defined\n- Look for any existing settings UI elements or placeholders\n- Check GlassHUD for settings button implementation\n- Search for any references to expert settings or configuration\n\nUse \"medium\" thoroughness. Return a summary of:\n1. What settings-related code exists\n2. What audio parameter state management exists\n3. What's missing for Settings Panel implementation\n4. Any existing UI elements that need to be connected","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"task_id: ses_39d5e8660ffeIsOOOJqcoZ4tlQ (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\nBased on my comprehensive search of the codebase, here's a detailed summary of settings-related code:\n\n## 1. What Settings-Related Code Exists\n\n### Type Definitions\n**Location**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/types/index.ts`\n\n- **ExpertSettings** interface (lines 103-109) with complete type definitions:\n  - `movementDetection`: MovementDetectionParams\n  - `scoring`: ScoringConfig\n  - `levelGeneration`: LevelGenerationParams\n  - `gridSizing`: GridSizingParams\n  - `audio`: AudioParams\n\n- **AudioParams** interface (lines 97-101):\n  - `enabled`: boolean\n  - `volume`: number\n  - `waveform`: 'sine' | 'triangle' | 'square' | 'sawtooth'\n\n### Configuration Creator Functions\n**Movement Detection**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/movement.ts`\n- `createInitialMovementDetectionParams()` (line 247-253)\n  - centroidHistoryLength: 5\n  - movementThreshold: 0.5\n  - minClusterSize: 1\n\n**Scoring**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/scoring.ts`\n- `createInitialScoringConfig()` (lines 66-72)\n  - moverPointsPerGeneration: 10\n  - oscillatorPointsPerGeneration: 2\n  - scoreMultiplier: 1.0\n\n**Level Generation**: Defined in types but no creator function exists yet\n\n**Grid Sizing**: Defined in types but no creator function exists yet\n\n**Audio**: Defined in types but no creator function exists yet\n\n### Settings UI Button\n**Location**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/GlassHUD.tsx`\n- Settings button exists at lines 136-138 (⚙️ emoji)\n- Prop `onToggleSettings` is defined in interface (line 25)\n- Button is in the last hud-group alongside \"Show/Hide Grid\" button\n\n### Settings Handler (Placeholder)\n**Location**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/Game.tsx`\n- `handleToggleSettings` function at lines 135-137\n- Currently just logs \"Settings panel toggled (not yet implemented)\"\n- Passed to GlassHUD at line 191\n\n### Storage Utilities\n**Location**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/state.ts`\n- `saveToLocalStorage<T>(key: string, value: T): boolean` (lines 79-89)\n- `loadFromLocalStorage<T>(key: string, defaultValue: T): T` (lines 91-102)\n- `removeFromLocalStorage(key: string): boolean` (lines 104-113)\n- Uses `STORAGE_KEY_PREFIX = 'gol-'` for consistent naming\n\n### Specification Documents\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/specs/expert-settings.md` - Complete expert settings spec\n- `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/specs/audio-sonification.md` - Audio system spec\n\n## 2. What Audio Parameter State Management Exists\n\n### Current State\n- **Type definitions complete**: AudioParams interface is fully defined\n- **No implementation**: No actual audio parameter state management in components\n- **No creator function**: No `createInitialAudioParams()` function exists\n- **No audio engine**: No SoundEngine or Web Audio API implementation found\n- **Spec available**: Audio sonification spec provides detailed implementation guidance\n\n### Audio Spec Details\nFrom `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/specs/audio-sonification.md`:\n- Volume range: 0.0 to 0.5, default 0.1 (10%)\n- Waveform types: sine (default), triangle, square, sawtooth\n- SoundEngine interface defined with methods for generation and interaction sounds\n- Lazy initialization pattern for AudioContext\n\n## 3. What's Missing for Settings Panel Implementation\n\n### Missing Components\n1. **SettingsPanel component** - No component exists at all\n2. **Modal/Dialog UI** - IntroOverlay exists but no general-purpose modal component\n3. **Settings state management** - No useSettings hook or context provider\n4. **Audio parameter creator** - No `createInitialAudioParams()` function\n5. **Level generation creator** - No `createInitialLevelGenerationParams()` function\n6. **Grid sizing creator** - No `createInitialGridSizingParams()` function\n7. **Expert settings creator** - No `createInitialExpertSettings()` function\n\n### Missing State Management\n- No React Context for settings (as suggested in spec)\n- No Zustand or similar state management (package.json shows only React)\n- Settings not persisted to localStorage\n- No validation functions for expert settings (zod is available in dependencies)\n\n### Missing UI Elements\n- No modal/overlay pattern for settings panel\n- No collapsible sections/groups in existing UI\n- No slider components (though CSS classes exist: .hud-slider)\n- No dropdown/select components in settings (though GlassHUD has buttons)\n- No \"Reset to Defaults\" functionality\n- No Export/Import functionality for settings\n\n### Missing Integration\n- Settings not connected to simulation, movement detection, or scoring\n- Movement and scoring configs are hardcoded constants in Game.tsx\n- No way to update configs at runtime\n- Grid sizing is manual through presets, not configurable\n\n## 4. Existing UI Elements That Need to be Connected\n\n### GlassHUD Settings Button\n- **Status**: Button exists but only logs to console\n- **Location**: Line 136-138 in GlassHUD.tsx\n- **Needed**: Connect to open SettingsPanel modal\n\n### Existing UI Patterns to Reuse\n- **IntroOverlay**: Full-screen overlay pattern for intro sequence (32 lines)\n- **GlassHUD**: Glassmorphism styling, backdrop blur, button groups\n- **ScoreDisplay**: Animated values, milestone effects\n- **UIToggleButton**: SVG icon toggle pattern\n\n### CSS Classes Available\n- `.glass-hud` - Glassmorphism container\n- `.hud-button` - Button styling with hover effects\n- `.hud-slider` - Slider styling (defined but not used)\n- `.hud-select` - Dropdown styling (defined but not used)\n- Responsive breakpoints for mobile\n\n### State Management Pattern to Follow\n- **usePhaseTimer**: Custom hook pattern with reducer\n- **Flux state**: Simple state with creator functions\n- **Phase state**: Reducer pattern with actions\n- **Validation utilities**: Available in validation.ts\n\n## Recommendations for Implementation\n\n1. **Create creator functions** for all missing initial states (following existing pattern)\n2. **Build SettingsPanel component** as a modal overlay (reuse IntroOverlay pattern)\n3. **Create useSettings hook** for state management (following usePhaseTimer pattern)\n4. **Implement persistence** using existing localStorage utilities\n5. **Add validation** using existing validation utilities or zod\n6. **Integrate with Game component** to make settings live-configurable\n7. **Create Audio Engine** following the audio-sonification spec\n8. **Build UI controls** using existing CSS patterns\n\nThe codebase has excellent patterns and utilities to follow. The main gap is the complete absence of the Settings Panel implementation, though the foundation (types, storage utilities, UI patterns) is solid.\n</task_result>",